                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "In this chapter of the Witches' Legacy series, Edward goes in search of important information about his past, and needs to be rescued from evil magic on the eve of his wedding to your adopted daughter Lynn (the young witch from the three previous chapters).\n\nThese are excellent HOPA games, with high quality art, HO scenes, and puzzles.  The games are immersive and a very good length for the cost.  All but the first game have an interactive map, and all the later games have an indicator for collectable items (puzzle pieces and morphing objects).\n\nThe Imp take-along characters is a lot of fun in this chapter of the series!\n\nA solid 9+ out of 10.  Highly recommended series. Worth full price, but an even better deal in the bundle, especially on sale!",
